OL,3,ANew York City building collapse kills
OL,4,Aseveral people
OL,5,
OL,6,FAerial footage has shown firefighters
OL,7,Fpulling a survivor, covered in dust,
OL,8,Fout of the debris on a stretcher. She
OL,9,Fwas later said to have been a pregnant
OL,10,Fwoman.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
