OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom makes history as
OL,4,AMississippi's first black senator since
OL,5,A19th Century
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrat Scott Colom has won the US
OL,8,FSenate race in Mississippi, delivering
OL,9,Fa shock victory for the party in a
OL,10,Fdeeply conservative state that has
OL,11,Felected Republicans for decades.
OL,13,FColom's victory makes him the first
OL,14,Fblack person from Mississippi to be
OL,15,Fseated in the US Senate since Blanche
OL,16,FBruce served from 1875 to 1881.
OL,18,FFewer than five thousand votes out of
OL,19,Fnearly a million counted separated him
OL,20,Ffrom his Republican opponent, the
OL,21,Fincumbent Cindy Hyde-Smith.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
